<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Money Store started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Money Store started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it started coverage of the Money Store Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $32 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Katrina Blecher said in a research note her 1997 earnings estimate was $1.85 per share and her 1998 earnings estimate was $2.25 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Rapid growth in earnings and originations personify the Money Store,&quot; she said.  Extensive marketing was also fueling growth, Blecher said.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were up 5/8 at 26-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
